il","alt":"Moss leaf under microscope, showing gemmae and a hair point (40×)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMoss_leaf_under_microscope.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Moss_Gametophytes_Sporophytes.JPG/500px-Moss_Gametophytes_Sporophytes.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Moss_Gametophytes_Sporophytes.JPG/1280px-Moss_Gametophytes_Sporophytes.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Moss_Gametophytes_Sporophytes.JPG/500px-Moss_Gametophytes_Sporophytes.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A patch of moss showing both gametophytes (the low, leaf-like forms) and sporophytes (the tall, stalk-like forms)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMoss_Gametophytes_Sporophytes.JPG"}],"sounds":{}}}